{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Keep terminal waiters blocked through `onOperationChange`.** Terminal operation futures have already completed before this fatal-propagating hook runs. A resumed handler can execute an at-least-once step while the hook is blocked; if it then reports a fatal, the queued START can be discarded and replay repeats the side effect. Dispatch change hooks before completing terminal futures, and add a blocked terminal-change regression with a follow-up step.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xCKQ","finding_digest":"2ec144e6d7922e9aa3a8e7041782be2f4faa8c07697c1c489710a29503fe727c","finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","line":278,"observation_digest":"12346b81808b017bf50875b42c5ccb9d902d375f8da7bb77c010325482b2933a","observation_id":"aro_v1_ci2gxamarmaxx5iiow2cyxgltw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:45:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_523fpro2dldye6ezvg2q6x7mrp","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"e6a6d94fc7b34a020f2b5b8dbf1100d2be12e08b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":278,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_cs22vg45z6sglt47ioucbkxdng","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:45:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
